VulkanPMap (pm::)

GPU photon emission, compact-grid indexing, multi-bounce indirect GI,
glass transport, caustics and progressive irradiance.
Direct area-light shadows use an adaptive surface atlas; contact edges
can be refined with progressive per-pixel rays. Edge-aware filtering
does not contaminate temporal accumulation.
Public API: pmap/pmap.hpp; shaders: shaders/.
Host owns VulkanWrapper, command buffers and presentation.
